3267606\"><strong class=\"schema-faq-question\"><strong>Which hashtags do I have to use with study captions?<\/strong><\/strong> <p class=\"schema-faq-answer\">Your captions should include hashtags such as StudyMotivation, StudyGram, StudentLife, FocusMode, and ExamPrep. It is better to combine popular and niche hashtags. Make sure that they are applicable to your caption content to achieve better <a href=\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/what-is-seo\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">SEO<\/a> results.<\/p> <\/div> <div class=\"schema-faq-section\" id=\"faq-question-1773923281625\"><strong class=\"schema-faq-question\"><strong>Are funny study captions effective on Instagram?<\/strong><\/strong> <p class=\"schema-faq-answer\">Famous study captions work wonders since they are easy to identify with and go viral. Comedy boosts interest and time savings. It is better to add trending memes or funny lines to make your content popular and attract a larger number of students.<\/p> <\/div> <div class=\"schema-faq-section\" id=\"faq-question-1773923298638\"><strong class=\"schema-faq-question\"><strong>What is the length of a study caption in Instagram?<\/strong><\/strong> <p class=\"schema-faq-answer\">The perfect study caption must range between 100 and 200 words or fewer to be concise and to attract attention. The inclusion of keywords is bound to make it easier to achieve a superior SEO without interfering with the readability.<\/p> <\/div> <div class=\"schema-faq-section\" id=\"faq-question-1773923310817\"><strong class=\"schema-faq-question\"><strong>Which keywords should I use in the study captions to make it SEO-friendly?<\/strong><\/strong> <p class=\"schema-faq-answer\">Add keywords such as study captions, study motivation, student life, and exam preparation. These increase the visibility of search when used strategically. It is better to avoid stuffing with keywords and to be placed naturally in meaningful and interesting sentences.<\/p> <\/div> <